---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";

const services = [
  "Infrastructure Audit",
  "Capacity Planning",
  "Technology Roadmap",
  "DR Planning",
  "Cloud Integration",
  "Migration",
  "IT Health Monitoring",
  "IT Decommissioning",
];
---

<PageLayout
  title="IT Consulting"
  tagline="Consultancy is the bridge between challenges and solutions."
  description="Systemizer Technic's IT consulting services provide expert guidance to help clients align their technology strategies with their business goals, through strategic, architectural, operational, and implementation planning."
>
  <Section variant="light">
    <Container class="max-w-3xl">
      <p>
        Systemizer Technic's IT consulting services provide expert guidance to
        help clients align their technology strategies with their business
        goals. We support IT initiatives through strategic, architectural,
        operational, and implementation planning. Our services include assessing
        IT needs, designing systems with emerging technologies, evaluating
        operational efficiency, and advising on solution deployment.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Our unbiased experts offer guidance to enhance your IT operations,
        focusing on aligning the best technology solutions with your specific
        goals. With extensive industry experience, we understand the difference
        between theoretical and practical solutions. Our approach prioritizes
        what truly works for you, not just the latest technology.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        In a rapidly evolving technological landscape, we ensure you have access
        to the most innovative tools. Our commitment to your success drives us
        to continually refine our strategies and stay updated on industry
        trends.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Collaboration is at the heart of our philosophy. We see ourselves as
        partners in your journey toward IT excellence, providing support and
        expertise at every step. By building a relationship based on trust and
        mutual respect, we empower you to achieve and exceed your goals.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Together, we can transform your IT vision into reality, propelling your
        business forward and setting you apart from the competition. Let's
        embark on this transformative journey and unlock the full potential of
        your IT operations.
      </p>
    </Container>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="surface">
    <Container>
      <h2 class="text-h2">Our Consulting Services</h2>
      <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {
          services.map((service) => (
            <li class="rounded-lg border border-brand-surface bg-brand-light p-4 text-center font-medium text-brand-secondary">
              {service}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <Button href="/contact/">Request a Quote</Button>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>
</PageLayout>
